{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migratingadapter", "label": "migratingAdapter", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Fuer nicht-additive Migrationen - Umbenennungen, Restrukturierungen, aus anderen Feldern berechnete Felder, mehrstufige Evolution. currentVersion und Manifest liegen auf der Chain; die Optionen des Adapters steuern nur die Schreib-Version.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "label": "MigrationChain", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Gebaut mit MigrationChain.for<E>(manifest, currentVersion) und .add(step); Schritte muessen vorwaerts laufen. Die Chain laeuft vom Cursor der gespeicherten Version vorwaerts bis currentVersion, wobei die Zwischentypen keiner historischen Event-Form entsprechen muessen - sie sind nur Trittsteine.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationstep", "label": "MigrationStep<From, To>", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Upcaster sind einfache Funktionen und koennen ueber Konstruktor-Argumente des Actors schliessen - nuetzlich fuer Per-Instanz-Migrationskontext wie Per-Tenant-Defaults oder Per-Region-Waehrung.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_downcaster", "label": "Downcaster (addDown)", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Waehrend eines Rolling-Deploys muessen v2-Nodes womoeglich weiterhin v1-Events emittieren, solange v1-Reader im Cluster sind. writeVersion muss <= currentVersion sein und die Chain braucht Downcaster fuer jeden Schritt auf dem Pfad currentVersion -> writeVersion, sonst wirft toJournal.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationerror", "label": "MigrationError", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Eine Chain-Luecke - kein Upcaster fuer den Cursor registriert, bevor currentVersion erreicht ist - wirft MigrationError und nennt die fehlende fromVersion. Wirft ein Schritt selbst, schlaegt die Recovery fehl und der Fehler kommt ueber onRecoveryFailure zum Vorschein.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migratingsnapshotadapter", "label": "migratingSnapshotAdapter", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Dieselbe Chain, gibt einen SnapshotAdapter fuer Snapshot- und Durable-State-Datensaetze zurueck.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_pure_upcaster", "label": "Upcaster sind pur", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Sie laufen bei jeder Recovery fuer jedes betroffene Event; Seiteneffekte wie API-Calls oder DB-Lookups verdoppeln sich pro Recovery und verlangsamen den Replay. Vorab berechnen und extern cachen, falls noetig.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_never_change_steps", "label": "Bestehende Schritte nie aendern", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Schritte, die Events behandelt haben, die noch im Journal liegen, sind tragend. Einen neuen Schritt hinzufuegen und die Chain-Version bumpen; wird currentVersion zu niedrig gelassen, werden neue Events weiterhin in der alten Version geschrieben, und ein Schritt, dessen toVersion sie ueberschreitet, wirft beim Bauen. Versionen zu ueberspringen erzeugt eine Chain-Luecke, sobald ein Payload der uebersprungenen Version existiert.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migratingadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationstep", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_downcaster", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migratingsnapshotadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_pure_upcaster", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationstep", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_never_change_steps", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migrationchain", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_migrating_adapter_migratingadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_envelope_format_eventadapter", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/migrating-adapter.